---
import { basketSnapshot } from '../lib/local-costs.mjs';
const basket=basketSnapshot();
---
<section class="local-switchboard" aria-labelledby="local-switchboard-heading">
  <header><p>CH.ESC / 90245 / 25 MILES</p><h2 id="local-switchboard-heading">The local switchboard.</h2></header>
  <div class="local-switchboard__cards">
    <a href="/outages" class="local-switchboard__card local-switchboard__card--power"><span>01 / LOCAL SIGNAL</span><h3>IS THE<br/>SIGNAL ON?</h3><p>Check power, weather and the other interruptions in a day.</p><strong>Open the outage tracker</strong></a>
    <a href="/local-costs" class="local-switchboard__card local-switchboard__card--cost"><span>02 / THE BIG LOCAL BASKET</span><h3>WHAT’S<br/>THE COST?</h3><p>Gas, coffee, electricity, fruit, lumber, movies. {basket.items.length} everyday costs with dated evidence.</p><strong>Open the costs dashboard</strong><small>People + visiting agents can bring back a sourced price.</small></a>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.local-switchboard{margin:28px 0 36px;color:#101018}.local-switchboard header{margin-bottom:16px}.local-switchboard header p{font:700 .875rem/1.5 var(--pc-font-mono);margin:0 0 8px}.local-switchboard h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.5rem);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0;line-height:1.1}.local-switchboard__cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.local-switchboard__card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:24px;border:3px solid #101018;box-shadow:5px 5px 0 #101018;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.local-switchboard__card--power{background:#1544d3;color:#fff}.local-switchboard__card--cost{background:#ffdf31}.local-switchboard__card>span{font:700 .875rem/1.5 var(--pc-font-mono)}.local-switchboard h3{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.8rem);line-height:.93;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:22px 0;font-weight:950}.local-switchboard__card p{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5;max-width:440px;margin:0 0 20px}.local-switchboard__card strong{margin-top:auto;font-size:1rem;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.local-switchboard__card small{font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.5;margin-top:12px}.local-switchboard__card:focus-visible{outline:4px solid #db342b;outline-offset:5px}.local-switchboard__card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}@media(max-width:620px){.local-switchboard__cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.local-switchboard__card{padding:20px}}
</style>
